WEBVTT

01:41.470 --> 01:45.960
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.710 --> 01:48.920
[Episode 12]

01:49.680 --> 01:50.350
How did I...

01:51.120 --> 01:51.870
The Resentment Liquid has been neutralized.

01:52.229 --> 01:52.990
You can leave now.

02:05.120 --> 02:05.680
Shui,

02:07.200 --> 02:08.310
actually, you and I

02:08.840 --> 02:09.630
shouldn't have come to this.

02:16.910 --> 02:17.800
What are you doing here?

02:19.280 --> 02:20.230
You really dare to act

02:20.260 --> 02:21.450
as if you're the Guardian of this place.

02:22.680 --> 02:23.240
Qingge,

02:23.310 --> 02:23.960
how are you feeling?

02:26.430 --> 02:26.960
Yu,

02:27.680 --> 02:29.190
Shui has already helped me neutralize the Resentment Liquid.

02:32.000 --> 02:32.590
You should have told me

02:32.610 --> 02:33.500
you were coming here.

02:33.970 --> 02:34.720
Mount Wester has been occupied

02:34.750 --> 02:35.680
by this man for over a decade.

02:35.710 --> 02:37.000
It's no longer the same as when you were here.

02:38.120 --> 02:38.630
How can this man

02:39.470 --> 02:40.360
be trusted?

02:41.870 --> 02:42.470
Yu,

02:43.470 --> 02:44.590
times have changed.

02:45.400 --> 02:47.079
Why do you always

02:47.480 --> 02:48.829
have to be so confrontational with Shui?

02:53.240 --> 02:54.240
The matter is settled.

02:54.470 --> 02:55.120
Just get out of here.

03:01.430 --> 03:02.120
Young Master Yu.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.030
Why are you here?

03:04.870 --> 03:05.520
Ranran?

03:13.120 --> 03:13.710
Ranran?

03:14.470 --> 03:15.030
Ranran?

03:19.079 --> 03:19.560
Ranran.

03:20.000 --> 03:21.360
You know His Highness?

03:22.340 --> 03:23.260
What?

03:26.710 --> 03:27.470
Are you saying

03:28.550 --> 03:30.360
Young Master Yu is the Crown Prince?

03:31.560 --> 03:33.390
So his annual visits to the foot of Mount Absolute

03:33.930 --> 03:35.210
were all to wait for Master Mu?

03:36.800 --> 03:37.560
I knew it.

03:37.910 --> 03:39.090
Clearly, His Highness

03:39.120 --> 03:39.960
is here

03:39.960 --> 03:41.360
for Master Mu.

03:42.890 --> 03:44.090
This is exactly

03:44.120 --> 03:45.280
like the rumor

03:45.310 --> 03:46.470
I heard before.

03:48.560 --> 03:49.360
What rumor?

03:50.630 --> 03:51.430
Stop being so mysterious.

03:53.710 --> 03:54.590
It's said

03:55.079 --> 03:56.800
that Master had feelings

03:57.150 --> 03:58.560
for the immortal master.

03:59.150 --> 04:00.310
But Master Mu

04:00.330 --> 04:01.770
only cared about the Prince Zong's legitimate son,

04:01.830 --> 04:03.790
now the Crown Prince.

04:04.280 --> 04:06.240
They were the ones truly in love.

04:07.360 --> 04:08.430
That's why Master

04:09.010 --> 04:10.170
turned love into hatred.

04:10.680 --> 04:11.520
In the end,

04:12.430 --> 04:13.240
he killed his master.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.400
Master is not the kind of person

04:14.400 --> 04:15.910
who would destroy something just because he couldn't have it.

04:16.160 --> 04:17.190
Stop spreading

04:17.190 --> 04:18.040
these ridiculous rumors.

04:18.630 --> 04:19.190
Exactly.

04:20.300 --> 04:21.230
Believe it or not.

04:21.800 --> 04:22.750
I'm leaving. Off to practice.

04:27.160 --> 04:27.630
Ranran,

04:28.900 --> 04:30.670
I saw how happy and admiring you were

04:30.870 --> 04:32.000
when you talked about Young Master Yu before.

04:32.600 --> 04:33.750
I was worried

04:33.770 --> 04:34.800
that you might be upset,

04:34.830 --> 04:35.560
since he's so close with Grandmaster.

04:36.740 --> 04:37.970
But you seem fine now.

04:38.040 --> 04:38.870
I'm relieved.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.000
I'm off to practice.

04:42.430 --> 04:43.070
Yeah.

04:43.920 --> 04:44.870
Weird.

04:45.750 --> 04:47.190
Why is it that now when I see him,

04:47.300 --> 04:48.940
I don't feel as happy as before?

05:04.630 --> 05:05.270
It's...

05:06.630 --> 05:08.110
My wishful thinking.

05:08.390 --> 05:09.360
But I am

05:09.560 --> 05:11.120
in love with Young Master Yu.

05:17.190 --> 05:17.720
Young...

05:20.390 --> 05:22.190
Your Highness, Master Mu,

05:22.310 --> 05:23.070
please have some tea.

05:25.800 --> 05:26.310
I apologize

05:26.750 --> 05:27.750
for concealing my identity earlier

05:27.750 --> 05:28.680
for convenience when I was out.

05:29.430 --> 05:30.190
From now on,

05:30.190 --> 05:31.000
you can still call me Young Master Yu.

05:31.630 --> 05:32.310
No need to be formal.

05:39.800 --> 05:40.720
How do you two know each other?

05:41.310 --> 05:42.510
Because of her winemaking skill.

05:43.680 --> 05:45.190
You must try the wine she made.

05:49.600 --> 05:50.980
Mount Wester doesn't entertain guests with wine.

06:00.830 --> 06:01.360
Ranran,

06:02.740 --> 06:03.530
look, someone

06:03.550 --> 06:04.550
has a habit of showing up uninvited.

06:05.040 --> 06:05.870
I'm catching up with you.

06:06.160 --> 06:06.950
What business is it of his?

06:09.480 --> 06:10.950
But how did you end up at Mount Wester?

06:12.430 --> 06:13.480
Some changes occurred.

06:14.310 --> 06:15.480
Luckily, Master saved me.

06:19.310 --> 06:20.120
You're inexperienced.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.390
Don't let yourself be deceived.

06:22.660 --> 06:23.620
If you're bullied,

06:24.240 --> 06:25.120
feel free to tell me.

06:27.630 --> 06:28.720
When did the affairs of Mount Wester

06:29.680 --> 06:31.270
become your place to gossip?

06:32.240 --> 06:33.600
Mount Wester, to me,

06:34.070 --> 06:35.630
is nothing more than Qingge's old residence.

06:36.240 --> 06:37.830
Back then, she liked staying here,

06:38.470 --> 06:39.480
so I built the palace

06:39.510 --> 06:40.530
to make her comfortable.

06:41.840 --> 06:43.730
Now the Eastern Palace is her residence.

06:44.390 --> 06:45.270
I couldn't care less

06:45.270 --> 06:46.600
if it's Mount Easter or Mount Wester.

06:49.720 --> 06:50.159
I'm merely

06:50.190 --> 06:51.390
reminding this young girl

06:51.600 --> 06:52.870
to be careful in dealing with others.

06:55.040 --> 06:56.460
Thank you for your kind intentions, Young Master Yu,

06:56.720 --> 06:58.159
but Master is very nice.

07:01.480 --> 07:02.040
Am I?

07:04.360 --> 07:05.160
Master

07:05.270 --> 07:06.720
wants me to praise him

07:06.720 --> 07:07.430
in front of Grandmaster?

07:08.830 --> 07:10.390
Master is not good with words

07:10.680 --> 07:11.950
and may appear cold on the surface.

07:12.700 --> 07:13.700
But, in fact,

07:13.950 --> 07:14.920
he is very responsible

07:15.720 --> 07:16.800
and is willing to help the weak.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.680
He's kind-hearted and gentle.

07:20.600 --> 07:21.270
Especially when it comes to those

07:21.270 --> 07:22.240
who are most important to him,

07:23.530 --> 07:24.930
he always gives his all

07:25.000 --> 07:26.070
and silently dedicates himself.

07:27.120 --> 07:27.630
Ranran,

07:28.360 --> 07:29.800
you've only known him for a few days.

07:31.360 --> 07:32.270
He

07:33.680 --> 07:35.130
is the most heartless.

07:35.750 --> 07:36.750
He turns on people without mercy.

07:37.950 --> 07:38.800
Do you think

07:38.800 --> 07:40.040
someone

07:41.510 --> 07:42.270
who even killed his own master

07:43.550 --> 07:44.730
has any conscience left?

07:50.159 --> 07:50.680
Yu,

07:52.390 --> 07:53.070
it's all in the past.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.480
Why bring up old matters?

07:56.159 --> 07:56.750
Qingge,

07:57.680 --> 07:58.600
you're magnanimous,

07:58.600 --> 07:59.750
but what happened can't be changed.

08:00.510 --> 08:01.480
He will forever

08:01.480 --> 08:02.240
let you down.

08:03.950 --> 08:05.750
He doesn't deserve your forgiveness.

08:12.320 --> 08:13.840
You've had your tea. No need to see you out.

08:13.920 --> 08:14.430
Why?

08:15.630 --> 08:17.000
Trying to drive us away because the truth hurts?

08:19.360 --> 08:19.950
Ranran,

08:20.750 --> 08:22.270
you must see his true colors.

08:23.630 --> 08:24.460
If you ask me,

08:24.720 --> 08:26.200
you should leave this evil master immediately.

08:26.830 --> 08:27.910
Come down the mountain with us.

08:28.170 --> 08:29.560
It would be better to cultivate with Qingge.

08:29.870 --> 08:30.680
You're asking for death!

08:31.120 --> 08:32.330
Su Yishui, have you lost your mind?

08:32.429 --> 08:33.400
Master, please calm your anger!

08:33.840 --> 08:34.870
Su Yishui!

08:35.909 --> 08:37.030
You dare to do it but not admit it?

08:38.270 --> 08:40.320
Your hands are stained with Mu Qingge's blood.

08:41.549 --> 08:42.480
Do you still expect her

08:42.480 --> 08:43.480
to treat you as before?

08:44.080 --> 08:45.360
Young Master Yu was just joking.

08:45.870 --> 08:47.030
He's not a cultivator.

08:47.160 --> 08:48.400
You'll hurt him if you continue like this.

08:51.910 --> 08:52.550
You and I

08:53.120 --> 08:54.390
shall never meet again,

08:55.230 --> 08:56.230
for eternity.

09:01.360 --> 09:01.870
Get out!

09:02.340 --> 09:02.950
Are you all right?

09:03.360 --> 09:03.870
I'm fine.

09:25.390 --> 09:25.960
Your Highness,

09:26.680 --> 09:27.520
Master Mu's magical artifacts

09:27.550 --> 09:28.240
are all here.

09:29.030 --> 09:30.090
Please check if anything is missing.

09:31.000 --> 09:32.150
What about the Ironclad White Tiger?

09:32.960 --> 09:34.510
Bai doesn't want to come out.

09:34.720 --> 09:35.240
All of us

09:35.270 --> 09:36.390
couldn't budge it no matter how hard we tried.

09:36.720 --> 09:37.720
Since its spiritual power has been damaged,

09:37.750 --> 09:38.750
it's now the size of a tiny kitten.

09:39.240 --> 09:39.880
Master Mu,

09:39.910 --> 09:41.080
I guess you won't need it anymore, right?

09:41.960 --> 09:42.390
That beast,

09:42.410 --> 09:43.770
once so affectionate towards you,

09:44.030 --> 09:45.120
has now turned its back on you.

09:46.180 --> 09:47.060
Never mind, let's not force it.

09:47.790 --> 09:49.200
Yu, let's go.

09:56.960 --> 09:58.600
Why, compared to Young Master Yu,

09:59.870 --> 10:00.600
do I care more about

10:00.600 --> 10:01.720
whether Master is happy or not?

10:03.840 --> 10:05.790
Master is so upset because of Grandmaster,

10:07.000 --> 10:08.240
and I feel sad too.

10:10.120 --> 10:10.790
Where are you going?

10:14.000 --> 10:15.270
Still thinking of seeing Su Yu off?

10:15.870 --> 10:16.390
No.

10:16.720 --> 10:17.910
They've left.

10:18.550 --> 10:19.480
I saw that you

10:19.510 --> 10:20.630
were very angry today,

10:20.960 --> 10:21.870
so I wanted

10:21.870 --> 10:22.910
to prepare some cooling tea for you.

10:26.000 --> 10:26.840
You'd better be.

10:28.480 --> 10:29.000
Yes.

10:31.320 --> 10:32.270
Don't be fond of Su Yu.

10:32.920 --> 10:33.600
He's not good enough.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.720
How jealous is Master

10:35.720 --> 10:37.480
because of Grandmaster?

10:37.910 --> 10:39.200
Master's really confused by anger.

10:39.480 --> 10:41.080
Why didn't you say this to Grandmaster?

10:42.440 --> 10:43.000
What?

10:43.870 --> 10:44.750
I think

10:45.080 --> 10:46.720
you clearly have something on your mind,

10:47.030 --> 10:48.390
yet you keep your heart closed,

10:48.440 --> 10:49.360
making it impossible for others to see through you.

10:50.120 --> 10:51.200
If I were Grandmaster,

10:51.360 --> 10:53.030
I would naturally think Young Master Yu is better too

10:53.120 --> 10:53.960
and more likable.

10:54.000 --> 10:54.550
Shut up!

10:54.870 --> 10:55.840
No, Master,

10:56.030 --> 10:56.630
I just think

10:56.630 --> 10:58.000
you could tell Grandmaster your...

11:29.870 --> 11:30.480
What's wrong?

11:40.270 --> 11:40.960
Stiffly Su,

11:41.480 --> 11:43.000
can't you calm down?

11:43.750 --> 11:45.120
What's triggered you this time?

11:45.720 --> 11:47.130
Is it because of that Su Yu?

11:47.510 --> 11:48.000
Listen.

11:48.030 --> 11:49.080
Given your condition,

11:49.550 --> 11:50.270
I'm afraid you won't be able

11:50.270 --> 11:51.440
to suppress the backfire of the Ice Lotus Technique,

11:51.440 --> 11:51.960
you know?

11:56.080 --> 11:57.840
She's Ranran now,

11:57.900 --> 11:58.880
and all those past events

11:58.910 --> 11:59.600
between you two

11:59.620 --> 12:00.990
have nothing to do with her anymore.

12:01.550 --> 12:03.240
She has her own life now.

12:03.440 --> 12:04.290
Whether it's Su Yu

12:04.320 --> 12:05.200
or anyone else,

12:05.220 --> 12:06.530
it's not something you can control.

12:06.720 --> 12:07.320
Do you understand?

12:07.720 --> 12:08.390
I'm telling you,

12:08.670 --> 12:09.970
you'd better bury those little thoughts of yours

12:10.000 --> 12:11.150
deep down.

12:12.080 --> 12:13.270
If the backfire hits

12:13.480 --> 12:14.910
and shatters your Ice Lotus core,

12:15.120 --> 12:16.550
causing you to lose your Transcendence Realm power,

12:16.600 --> 12:18.200
how will you seal the Spirit Spring?

12:19.390 --> 12:20.000
Master.

12:22.030 --> 12:22.600
Stay still.

12:26.840 --> 12:27.960
This stubborn blockhead.

12:31.870 --> 12:32.360
Ranran,

12:32.960 --> 12:34.180
you've come to bring food for your master?

12:35.240 --> 12:36.270
The weather suddenly changed.

12:36.310 --> 12:37.500
Some hot soup would be comforting.

12:38.720 --> 12:39.670
He can't eat anything.

12:39.960 --> 12:40.480
Don't worry about him.

12:41.360 --> 12:42.200
It's so cold out.

12:42.630 --> 12:43.600
You should go back and rest.

12:44.640 --> 12:45.640
But I said something wrong

12:45.670 --> 12:46.910
and upset Master.

12:47.080 --> 12:48.320
I should apologize and accept punishment.

12:48.750 --> 12:49.750
I'm worried about Master.

12:50.480 --> 12:51.670
What do you have to apologize for?

12:52.440 --> 12:53.750
Since it's his own problem,

12:54.030 --> 12:55.480
he should deal with it himself.

12:56.390 --> 12:57.600
Do you know why I didn't reunite with Master

12:57.630 --> 12:59.270
when she returned to Mount Wester?

12:59.720 --> 13:00.790
Master has finally gotten a chance

13:00.790 --> 13:01.870
to live again.

13:02.160 --> 13:03.210
We, as her disciples,

13:03.240 --> 13:04.510
shouldn't become her burden.

13:07.390 --> 13:07.910
Right?

13:10.200 --> 13:10.810
All right, all right.

13:10.840 --> 13:11.600
Look, the weather has changed.

13:11.910 --> 13:12.600
Hurry back, hurry back.

13:13.030 --> 13:13.630
Mr. Zeng.

13:13.720 --> 13:14.690
Let's go. Let's go.

13:26.840 --> 13:27.440
Yu.

13:29.240 --> 13:30.320
I went to find Shui.

13:31.080 --> 13:31.870
Are you not happy about that?

13:33.600 --> 13:35.320
I'm afraid the ungrateful man

13:35.320 --> 13:36.200
would hurt you again.

13:37.360 --> 13:38.030
Qingge,

13:38.810 --> 13:40.170
you used to protect me in the past.

13:40.550 --> 13:41.150
But now,

13:41.150 --> 13:42.510
I am the Crown Prince regent.

13:42.790 --> 13:43.840
I've also recruited talented individuals

13:43.870 --> 13:44.800
and established the Exotic Pavilion.

13:45.620 --> 13:46.170
With me here,

13:46.200 --> 13:47.320
you don't need to rely on anyone else.

13:48.000 --> 13:49.360
I've already died once.

13:50.360 --> 13:51.240
In this life,

13:51.960 --> 13:53.200
I understand

13:53.910 --> 13:54.840
who truly cares for me.

13:55.670 --> 13:56.320
Qingge.

13:58.720 --> 14:00.360
You've finally understood my feelings for you.

14:02.030 --> 14:02.870
This time,

14:04.600 --> 14:05.910
I can't miss the opportunity again.

14:23.720 --> 14:25.320
I intended to propose back then,

14:26.550 --> 14:27.910
but I was a step too late.

14:29.390 --> 14:30.320
I hope

14:31.030 --> 14:32.390
that popping the question now

14:34.790 --> 14:35.750
is not too late.

14:42.150 --> 14:43.000
Qingge,

14:46.450 --> 14:47.090
would you be willing

14:47.120 --> 14:48.160
to become my Crown Princess?

14:49.670 --> 14:50.510
I've waited for this moment

14:51.600 --> 14:52.840
for 18 years.

14:55.750 --> 14:56.910
This famine has swept through this place.

14:57.550 --> 14:58.440
Along the Jiangnan region,

14:59.270 --> 15:00.550
who knows how many refugees have died.

15:01.750 --> 15:03.090
Give it to me! This is mine!

15:03.120 --> 15:04.350
Don't hit my sister!

15:04.480 --> 15:05.790
Don't hit my sister!

15:06.550 --> 15:07.120
Give it to me!

15:07.390 --> 15:07.960
Stop it!

15:13.080 --> 15:14.960
Qingge, are you all right?

15:16.070 --> 15:16.510
Yes.

15:17.720 --> 15:18.120
Here.

15:18.360 --> 15:19.360
This is from the lord.

15:24.960 --> 15:26.030
Your sister is still hungry.

15:28.670 --> 15:29.670
Shouldn't you save some for her?

15:30.370 --> 15:31.120
It's okay.

15:31.790 --> 15:32.630
I don't need it.

15:34.000 --> 15:34.870
This girl is generous.

15:35.510 --> 15:36.480
Why don't we take her back to the mansion

15:36.630 --> 15:37.440
to do some work?

15:39.120 --> 15:40.200
Would you like that, Miss?

15:43.150 --> 15:44.270
I'd rather be free

15:44.670 --> 15:45.630
than be a slave to wealth.

15:46.000 --> 15:47.480
I will carve out a path for myself.

15:47.990 --> 15:49.380
For your kindness of a meal,

15:48.480 --> 15:51.010
[Young Mu Qingge]

15:50.200 --> 15:51.670
I will surely repay you in the future.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.360
Fine, I'll wait for you.

16:01.150 --> 16:01.910
Qingge,

16:01.390 --> 16:03.690
[Young Mu Ranwu]

16:02.390 --> 16:04.240
why don't we go?

16:06.150 --> 16:06.960
Wu,

16:07.720 --> 16:10.150
relying on others is not a long-term solution.

16:10.630 --> 16:12.000
Besides, we've got arms and legs.

16:12.380 --> 16:13.650
We can completely rely on ourselves.

16:14.360 --> 16:15.000
Don't worry.

16:17.270 --> 16:18.120
With me here,

16:18.720 --> 16:20.120
I'll make sure you survive.

16:20.860 --> 16:22.430
'Rely on ourselves.' Well said.

16:23.030 --> 16:23.910
Interesting.

16:30.390 --> 16:31.380
I just saw that you

16:31.720 --> 16:32.910
seem to have some potential.

16:34.000 --> 16:35.240
Would you like to learn some real skills?

16:41.600 --> 16:42.120
Qingge,

16:42.670 --> 16:43.760
you truly deserve the Five Spirit Roots.

16:44.080 --> 16:45.030
You have already mastered

16:45.120 --> 16:46.000
all of my techniques.

16:46.600 --> 16:47.670
Today, you can graduate.

16:48.080 --> 16:48.670
I suppose,

16:49.000 --> 16:49.670
your name

16:49.670 --> 16:50.720
will soon be known in the martial world.

16:51.550 --> 16:52.150
In the future,

16:52.510 --> 16:53.630
you will surely become a legend.

16:56.480 --> 16:57.440
There is still a long way to go.

16:58.030 --> 16:59.480
Wu will also make progress,

16:59.960 --> 17:00.480
right?

17:02.720 --> 17:03.390
Wu,

17:03.790 --> 17:04.650
you must know

17:05.310 --> 17:06.349
that being ordinary is a blessing.

17:14.720 --> 17:15.270
Wu.

17:16.589 --> 17:17.960
Back then, when we were at our wits' end,

17:17.980 --> 17:19.410
if you had used that packet of arsenic,

17:19.440 --> 17:20.640
I would have been saved early on.

17:21.150 --> 17:22.280
We wouldn't have had to,

17:22.310 --> 17:23.240
in the freezing snow,

17:23.260 --> 17:24.630
walk for half a month.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.880
My Spirit Root was permanently damaged by the cold,

17:27.339 --> 17:28.950
which makes it hard for me to improve my cultivation.

17:29.480 --> 17:30.000
Why?

17:31.010 --> 17:32.080
Why do you always prioritize others' lives

17:32.110 --> 17:34.210
over mine?

17:34.550 --> 17:35.240
Wu,

17:35.790 --> 17:37.030
there are many other paths in this world.

17:37.480 --> 17:38.720
It's okay not to pursue cultivation.

17:39.400 --> 17:40.640
How can it be okay?

17:42.000 --> 17:43.720
You who pursue cultivation can live for thousands of years

17:43.740 --> 17:44.890
and never age.

17:46.880 --> 17:47.750
But what about me?

17:49.160 --> 17:50.440
I am a mortal.

17:51.820 --> 17:53.620
I will eventually grow old

17:54.400 --> 17:55.360
and die.

17:57.780 --> 17:59.130
You let me watch with open eyes

17:59.160 --> 18:01.400
the endless wonders of the immortal world,

18:02.640 --> 18:04.200
yet I get nothing.

18:04.880 --> 18:06.310
When I grow old,

18:09.830 --> 18:10.830
what will I do?

18:13.790 --> 18:14.510
Don't worry.

18:14.920 --> 18:15.550
When the time comes,

18:16.180 --> 18:16.750
I will refine the best elixir

18:16.780 --> 18:17.860
for you.

18:19.200 --> 18:20.410
You taught me

18:20.830 --> 18:22.960
that relying on others is not a long-term solution.

18:23.360 --> 18:25.510
I will not always be beneath you.

18:41.110 --> 18:42.830
I'm Mu Qingge and she's Mu Ranwu.

18:43.070 --> 18:43.880
We're here to repay a debt of gratitude.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.000
Repay a debt of gratitude?

18:45.590 --> 18:46.550
Eight years ago,

18:46.920 --> 18:48.030
you gave us

18:48.030 --> 18:48.920
the kindness of a meal.

18:49.440 --> 18:50.240
It's you.

18:50.790 --> 18:52.160
You've actually remembered until now.

18:53.440 --> 18:54.230
Since you're here,

18:54.550 --> 18:55.830
let's go to Prince Zong's residence and have a seat.

18:56.350 --> 18:57.250
-Sure.
-I have...

19:01.110 --> 19:02.540
Then let Wu go in my place.

19:07.620 --> 19:08.180
All right.

19:08.450 --> 19:10.260
[Prince Zong's Residence]

19:21.830 --> 19:22.680
Do you like it here?

19:23.990 --> 19:24.720
Yes, I do.

19:35.000 --> 19:36.160
I have refined my Golden Core.

19:36.530 --> 19:37.690
I can help Yu now.

19:48.960 --> 19:49.880
Why do I...

19:51.240 --> 19:52.480
Why is this happening?

19:53.590 --> 19:54.070
Wu,

19:54.720 --> 19:55.400
tell Yu

19:56.270 --> 19:57.290
I want to help him.

20:01.560 --> 20:02.710
What you can give him

20:03.270 --> 20:04.510
is something I can never give.

20:05.320 --> 20:06.640
How could he not want it?

20:09.240 --> 20:10.000
Compared to her,

20:10.000 --> 20:11.270
you lack far more than just magical power.

20:12.720 --> 20:14.310
You'll never compare to her.

20:18.030 --> 20:20.110
We are sisters!

20:21.070 --> 20:22.610
Yet how come all the good things in the universe

20:22.640 --> 20:24.480
are taken by you?

20:25.680 --> 20:27.750
You have your natural talent.

20:28.480 --> 20:31.030
I only resent that I'm not granted.

20:31.990 --> 20:33.030
Now,

20:34.400 --> 20:36.240
you're even taking away

20:36.270 --> 20:37.750
the only person I love.

20:39.110 --> 20:41.440
The worldly riches and honors

20:41.510 --> 20:43.350
are all being handed to you.

20:43.350 --> 20:44.200
Why?

20:45.880 --> 20:47.400
I don't believe in fate.

20:48.960 --> 20:50.200
I, Mu Ranwu,

20:50.220 --> 20:52.310
will definitely take everything of yours

20:54.790 --> 20:56.960
into my own hands.

21:03.070 --> 21:04.160
Qingge, will you marry me?

21:13.050 --> 21:14.670
Am I... Am I not dreaming?

21:18.920 --> 21:20.070
Living this life again

21:21.200 --> 21:22.640
has given me a chance

21:23.160 --> 21:24.270
to think through many things.

21:25.270 --> 21:26.310
I

21:26.510 --> 21:27.520
have let the past grievances all go.

21:28.200 --> 21:29.070
In this life,

21:30.350 --> 21:31.070
I only want to stay

21:31.070 --> 21:32.350
by the side of the most important person

21:33.590 --> 21:34.590
without wasting this life.

21:39.030 --> 21:39.920
I, Su Yu,

21:42.370 --> 21:43.700
will never let you down in this life.

21:48.720 --> 21:50.240
Once Father's health improves slightly,

21:51.030 --> 21:52.620
I will request permission to hold our grand wedding.

22:08.590 --> 22:09.680
The position of Crown Princess

22:10.270 --> 22:11.750
will finally be mine.

22:30.160 --> 22:31.030
M-Master.

22:32.640 --> 22:33.680
Why are you practicing at this time?

22:34.670 --> 22:35.380
No.

22:35.650 --> 22:37.210
I just wanted to dig up some Ice Lotus seeds

22:37.240 --> 22:38.480
to make lotus seed soup for you.

22:41.240 --> 22:42.000
Since you're idle,

22:42.380 --> 22:43.580
why don't you familiarize yourself with the techniques?

22:49.880 --> 22:51.500
With a heart as clear as ice,

22:51.520 --> 22:52.960
I'm fearless even if the sky collapses.

22:53.830 --> 22:55.480
Mind and spirit as one.

22:56.640 --> 22:57.720
What's so good about him anyway?

22:58.160 --> 22:58.730
Him?

22:59.590 --> 23:00.440
Young Master Yu?

23:01.570 --> 23:03.570
Master is indeed still concerned.

23:04.470 --> 23:05.160
It's understandable.

23:05.590 --> 23:07.160
Grandmaster left with Young Master Yu.

23:07.310 --> 23:08.710
Master must be very heartbroken.

23:08.960 --> 23:10.160
And I said such things.

23:11.640 --> 23:12.760
I should praise Master generously instead

23:12.790 --> 23:13.510
to make him feel better.

23:14.440 --> 23:15.770
No matter how good others are,

23:15.790 --> 23:17.280
they can't compare to you.

23:18.110 --> 23:19.550
You're elegant and otherworldly,

23:19.570 --> 23:20.510
like fine jade.

23:20.640 --> 23:21.550
You're lofty and above it all...

23:23.270 --> 23:23.720
No, that's not right.

23:23.960 --> 23:24.830
You aim high with far-reaching ambitions.

23:25.240 --> 23:26.200
Just like these Ice Lotus.

23:26.680 --> 23:27.920
They may seem cold at first glance,

23:28.110 --> 23:29.000
but upon closer inspection,

23:29.030 --> 23:30.320
they're refreshing to the heart and mind.

23:30.480 --> 23:32.190
They actually make one feel warm and close.

23:33.830 --> 23:34.640
Do you really think so?

23:35.380 --> 23:35.780
Of...

23:39.790 --> 23:41.070
The altar is a place of utmost purity.

23:41.510 --> 23:43.350
Only with a clear mind and spirit can one stand there.

23:43.610 --> 23:45.020
You will be thrown off if you lie.

23:45.450 --> 23:46.690
But I didn't lie.

23:47.180 --> 23:48.660
I just exaggerated a little bit.

23:49.110 --> 23:49.640
So,

23:50.110 --> 23:50.720
what's so good

23:51.440 --> 23:52.400
about Su Yu after all?

23:53.750 --> 23:55.320
Actually, you and Young Master Yu

23:55.350 --> 23:56.200
are different.

23:57.180 --> 23:58.750
He is a little gentler.

23:59.010 --> 23:59.840
When he smiles,

23:59.860 --> 24:01.230
it's like a warm spring breeze.

24:01.610 --> 24:02.130
But...

24:03.550 --> 24:04.960
There's still a 'but,' Master!

24:05.720 --> 24:07.520
But you may seem cold on the surface,

24:07.620 --> 24:08.900
yet you have a warm heart.

24:10.110 --> 24:12.030
I can't even repay Master's kindness,

24:12.350 --> 24:13.400
yet I angered him

24:13.400 --> 24:14.400
hundreds of times every day.

24:15.110 --> 24:16.520
Xue Ranran, look what you've done!

24:36.110 --> 24:36.640
Come out.

24:38.240 --> 24:38.790
Your Highness.

24:40.860 --> 24:42.760
From now on, you'll be responsible for protecting Qingge.

24:43.900 --> 24:45.140
However, given her personality,

24:45.920 --> 24:46.720
she won't accept it.

24:47.400 --> 24:48.510
Don't let her find out.

24:48.960 --> 24:49.400
Yes,

24:50.030 --> 24:50.750
I understand.

25:05.960 --> 25:06.640
Loser!

25:07.070 --> 25:08.000
You can only improve

25:07.280 --> 25:08.440
[Young Wei Jiu]

25:08.030 --> 25:08.920
to this level?

25:09.200 --> 25:10.140
[Old Sovereign of the Scarlet Sect]

25:09.290 --> 25:10.240
Too slow!

25:23.000 --> 25:23.590
My Lord.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.550
Who allowed you to enter?

25:26.310 --> 25:26.920
Get out!

25:29.490 --> 25:30.830
My Lord, you mustn't be too hasty.

25:31.240 --> 25:32.720
There's a risk of cultivation deviation.

25:33.350 --> 25:33.960
I

25:34.270 --> 25:35.510
happened to obtain a Spirit-Molding Pill.

25:36.270 --> 25:38.310
It can help you quickly restore your magical power.

25:40.720 --> 25:42.590
Such a useful item,

25:43.590 --> 25:45.350
and you don't use it yourself, Elder Tu?

25:52.750 --> 25:53.510
Tu Jiuyuan!

25:53.680 --> 25:54.160
You...

25:54.400 --> 25:55.030
How dare you...

25:55.270 --> 25:56.480
I am doing this for your own good, My Lord.

25:57.540 --> 25:58.690
Please rest assured and focus on your recovery, My Lord.

26:03.440 --> 26:04.440
This Spirit-Molding Pill

26:04.750 --> 26:05.750
is indeed beneficial, to my surprise.

26:09.790 --> 26:10.550
Tu Jiuyuan.

26:11.960 --> 26:13.350
Although I am in seclusion,

26:14.300 --> 26:15.170
I still have my informants

26:15.200 --> 26:16.570
watch your every move

26:16.960 --> 26:18.110
and pay attention to the news about the Spirit Spring.

26:19.480 --> 26:20.160
I advise you

26:20.480 --> 26:22.520
not to harbor any thoughts of usurping my position.

26:30.510 --> 26:31.070
Elder.

26:34.110 --> 26:35.030
You have already offered the Spirit-Molding Pill

26:35.030 --> 26:36.030
to our lord?

26:37.600 --> 26:38.320
It isn't in vain that you

26:38.340 --> 26:39.340
went to great lengths to collect spirit fruits

26:39.590 --> 26:41.200
and used your heart's blood to refine this pill.

26:41.830 --> 26:43.000
Now that our lord has benefited from it,

26:43.410 --> 26:44.080
he will surely

26:44.110 --> 26:45.240
understand your loyalty

26:45.640 --> 26:46.350
and won't keep targeting you anymore,

26:46.350 --> 26:47.160
right?

26:48.550 --> 26:49.480
As long as half of the Scarlet Sect Token

26:49.510 --> 26:50.930
remains in my possession,

26:52.040 --> 26:52.800
he will continue

26:52.830 --> 26:54.030
to see me as a thorn in his side.

26:56.030 --> 26:57.440
But I promised the former sovereign

26:57.920 --> 26:59.430
to safeguard the Scarlet Sect Token in my hands.

27:01.720 --> 27:02.960
This was the former sovereign's dying wish.

27:08.680 --> 27:09.200
Yes.

27:29.950 --> 27:30.580
[Young Tu Jiuyuan]

27:48.720 --> 27:49.920
Wei Jiu, you're hurt.

27:50.640 --> 27:51.720
It's nothing.

27:52.270 --> 27:53.240
Stop whining.

27:56.310 --> 27:57.160
Here's a Revitalizing Pill.

27:57.920 --> 27:58.350
Take it.

28:04.200 --> 28:05.200
There's only one.

28:05.510 --> 28:06.070
What about you?

28:06.510 --> 28:07.880
When I tell you to take it, just take it quickly.

28:09.550 --> 28:11.040
We're a team for this trial.

28:11.320 --> 28:12.440
I'm your boss.

28:13.720 --> 28:14.960
As long as you don't hold me back,

28:15.590 --> 28:16.720
we'll definitely win.

28:19.310 --> 28:20.110
From now on,

28:20.680 --> 28:22.160
I won't hold you back anymore.

28:26.310 --> 28:27.310
Those times from before

28:29.370 --> 28:30.610
can never be found again.

28:42.210 --> 28:44.210
Grandmaster's Nine-Transformation Dark Iron Furnace.

28:48.000 --> 28:49.720
Master actually gave it to me.

28:50.830 --> 28:52.400
And I even made Master angry.

28:52.750 --> 28:54.240
That was really inappropriate of me.

28:54.720 --> 28:55.550
What?

28:55.830 --> 28:57.310
You even dared to add fuel to the fire?

28:59.830 --> 29:01.070
I heard that back then, Grandmaster

29:01.240 --> 29:02.830
was the universe's top alchemist.

29:03.440 --> 29:04.610
All she wanted

29:04.640 --> 29:06.110
was to create the best pill in the world for her sister.

29:07.100 --> 29:08.750
To think that Grandmaster, a Demon's child,

29:08.920 --> 29:10.400
actually cared so deeply for someone.

29:11.360 --> 29:12.170
If you ask me,

29:12.200 --> 29:12.960
there are many legends

29:13.000 --> 29:14.160
surrounding Grandmaster.

29:14.750 --> 29:16.200
Ever since she came up the mountain,

29:16.450 --> 29:17.170
this entire Mount Wester

29:17.200 --> 29:18.350
has been enveloped in the scent

29:18.350 --> 29:18.960
of Master's heartbreak.

29:19.160 --> 29:20.510
I can hardly breathe.

29:21.840 --> 29:22.880
When will these bitter days

29:23.160 --> 29:24.790
finally come to an end?

29:25.350 --> 29:26.960
It seems Master's heartbreak

29:27.070 --> 29:27.960
is truly severe.

29:28.490 --> 29:29.800
We need to quickly find a way

29:29.830 --> 29:30.720
to help him recover.

29:33.550 --> 29:34.110
Oh, right.

29:34.790 --> 29:35.680
The Collection of Entertainment

29:35.680 --> 29:36.960
mentions how to make dried longan.

29:37.590 --> 29:38.680
Why don't I

29:38.680 --> 29:39.730
make some of Master's favorite food

29:40.000 --> 29:40.790
as a form of food therapy?

29:42.640 --> 29:43.270
I'll get going now.

29:43.680 --> 29:44.110
Okay.

29:48.640 --> 29:50.200
Heartbreak.

29:56.310 --> 29:58.030
I've also thought of a good idea.

30:00.990 --> 30:02.500
It's hard to choose, isn't it?

30:04.790 --> 30:06.210
What are you all gathered here for?

30:07.130 --> 30:08.370
Ranran, look, look.

30:08.400 --> 30:08.720
Have a seat.

30:08.920 --> 30:09.790
As the saying goes,

30:10.480 --> 30:12.480
'There are plenty of fish in the sea.'

30:13.590 --> 30:14.520
To get over heartbreak,

30:14.550 --> 30:16.000
the best way

30:16.680 --> 30:17.550
is to start a new relationship.

30:18.550 --> 30:19.680
As long as we

30:19.830 --> 30:21.210
find a female immortal master

30:21.240 --> 30:21.920
as beautiful as Grandmaster,

30:22.640 --> 30:23.400
we don't need to worry about

30:23.590 --> 30:24.720
Master not finding a satisfactory partner,

30:24.750 --> 30:25.960
do we?

30:26.400 --> 30:27.650
Is it okay for you to do this?

30:27.680 --> 30:29.160
Would this method go too far?

30:29.550 --> 30:30.440
Don't worry.

30:31.030 --> 30:31.790
I've heard

30:31.790 --> 30:33.720
that Master was originally from a noble family,

30:34.070 --> 30:35.080
so he's not really

30:35.110 --> 30:36.160
a person of few desires.

30:37.310 --> 30:38.750
Since he could like Grandmaster,

30:39.160 --> 30:39.850
he can naturally

30:39.880 --> 30:40.960
like other female immortal masters,

30:41.160 --> 30:41.550
right?

30:42.160 --> 30:43.070
Weird.

30:43.970 --> 30:44.760
Even though I know

30:44.790 --> 30:46.030
it's to help Master move on,

30:46.590 --> 30:47.480
why do I

30:47.700 --> 30:48.610
feel somewhat

30:48.640 --> 30:49.590
uneasy about it?

30:50.920 --> 30:51.550
Xue Ranran,

30:52.000 --> 30:53.000
you must have practiced too much in the Ice Lotus Pool

30:53.030 --> 30:54.000
and become confused.

30:57.160 --> 30:58.150
Master.

31:01.550 --> 31:02.680
Why aren't you practicing?

31:03.000 --> 31:04.160
Why are you fiddling with books and paintings here?

31:12.720 --> 31:13.570
Master,

31:13.920 --> 31:15.240
we just feel that Mount Wester

31:15.270 --> 31:16.440
is a bit too quiet.

31:16.590 --> 31:18.440
Why don't we invite some immortal masters

31:18.510 --> 31:19.310
to visit here?

31:30.850 --> 31:31.940
Master, look.

31:32.400 --> 31:35.000
This Master Song Qingyan from the Qingyang Sect

31:35.410 --> 31:36.040
was top-ranked

31:36.070 --> 31:37.590
in last year's Immortal Beauty Rankings.

31:38.200 --> 31:39.930
Master, can you tell

31:40.000 --> 31:40.960
how old she is?

31:44.160 --> 31:45.200
This Master Song

31:45.400 --> 31:47.190
is best at the art of preserving youth.

31:47.510 --> 31:48.830
So, even in her forties,

31:49.150 --> 31:50.480
she can still remain pure and elegant,

31:50.920 --> 31:51.920
surpassing all in beauty.

31:52.640 --> 31:53.510
Master,

31:53.830 --> 31:54.830
don't you want to invite her

31:54.830 --> 31:56.070
to visit Mount Wester

31:56.720 --> 31:58.440
and learn some immortal techniques?

32:01.480 --> 32:02.510
She has a nice name.

32:03.240 --> 32:04.310
It suits her temperament.

32:07.110 --> 32:08.550
But what does it have to do with me?

32:09.480 --> 32:11.640
You may not know

32:11.920 --> 32:12.920
that in the immortal realm,

32:12.920 --> 32:14.240
there's a saying that goes,

32:14.880 --> 32:15.880
'Su Yishui is the most handsome among all men,

32:16.200 --> 32:17.160
and Song Qingyan is the most beautiful among all women.'

32:17.720 --> 32:18.720
Some matchmakers

32:18.830 --> 32:19.590
have already paired you two

32:19.590 --> 32:20.480
together.

32:22.030 --> 32:23.800
Master, take a closer look.

32:23.830 --> 32:24.590
You're truly a perfect match.

32:25.070 --> 32:25.790
You're truly a perfect match.

32:31.560 --> 32:32.710
If you're willing,

32:33.480 --> 32:35.680
why don't you invite Master Song to Mount Wester

32:35.960 --> 32:37.480
to discuss the art of preserving youth?

32:38.030 --> 32:39.270
Wouldn't that be a wonderful thing?

32:40.750 --> 32:42.030
Since you've wasted so much breath,

32:42.580 --> 32:43.930
you think I'm too old, huh?

32:44.550 --> 32:45.820
No, no, no!

32:45.840 --> 32:46.920
Master,

32:47.200 --> 32:48.070
you're so vibrant.

32:48.200 --> 32:49.270
You seem even younger than me.

32:52.310 --> 32:52.750
Let's try another.

32:53.160 --> 32:53.680
Let's try another.

32:58.440 --> 32:59.070
Master,

32:59.640 --> 33:00.250
what about

33:00.270 --> 33:01.900
Master Bi Yun from the Cangqiong Sect?

33:02.550 --> 33:03.220
It's said

33:03.480 --> 33:05.110
that she has a voice like a lark,

33:05.240 --> 33:06.640
clear and melodious.

33:07.240 --> 33:08.240
Just listening to her speak

33:08.500 --> 33:09.650
is like being in a celestial realm,

33:09.790 --> 33:10.680
making one's body and mind relaxed.

33:11.240 --> 33:12.240
If you

33:12.270 --> 33:13.510
have any worries,

33:13.880 --> 33:14.680
having her come here

33:15.070 --> 33:15.830
could solve them all.

33:18.880 --> 33:19.690
So you think

33:19.710 --> 33:20.620
my voice is unpleasant

33:20.790 --> 33:21.720
and I have worries, huh?

33:21.830 --> 33:22.970
No, no, no!

33:24.550 --> 33:25.720
Try another, come on.

33:34.310 --> 33:35.480
As for Master Wen,

33:36.030 --> 33:37.480
I don't need to say much, right?

33:38.590 --> 33:39.440
I heard

33:39.550 --> 33:41.550
you and she were childhood friends

33:42.350 --> 33:42.770
and...

33:46.960 --> 33:48.480
And you were quite compatible.

33:52.250 --> 33:53.560
If it weren't for Grandmaster back then,

33:53.590 --> 33:54.550
you and Master Wen

33:54.550 --> 33:55.680
would have already become a couple.

33:56.020 --> 33:57.000
Master, would you like

33:57.390 --> 33:58.240
to invite her to the mountain

33:58.270 --> 33:59.020
to reminisce about old times?

33:59.310 --> 33:59.750
Enough!

34:00.750 --> 34:01.350
I understand

34:01.350 --> 34:02.030
what you're all implying.

34:02.590 --> 34:03.830
How dare you

34:04.350 --> 34:05.030
meddle in

34:05.030 --> 34:05.880
your master's personal affairs!

34:06.590 --> 34:07.400
Pack all of these up!

34:07.830 --> 34:09.150
Go to the training field and practice for two extra hours.

34:09.330 --> 34:10.690
Yes, Master.

34:22.440 --> 34:22.960
Oh no!

34:23.590 --> 34:24.070
Ranran,

34:24.280 --> 34:25.080
why did you put the communication talisman in

34:25.110 --> 34:26.120
too?

34:27.540 --> 34:29.090
It's all been sent out.

34:29.560 --> 34:30.929
The peach blossoms on the back mountain have bloomed.

34:31.550 --> 34:32.800
Beautiful scenery needs a beauty to complement it.

34:34.110 --> 34:35.670
I have admired you for a long time

34:36.219 --> 34:37.179
and wish to invite you to enjoy the view together.

34:39.760 --> 34:40.920
Immortal Master, please have some tea.

34:53.110 --> 34:54.360
It's so lively here.

34:55.110 --> 34:56.150
Could it be

34:55.480 --> 34:57.220
[Master Peach Blossom]

34:56.380 --> 34:57.730
that you're all here to appreciate the flowers?

34:59.550 --> 35:01.030
Even Master Peach Blossom has come.

35:04.560 --> 35:05.970
You're even more elegant and handsome

35:06.000 --> 35:07.510
than the legends say.

35:08.480 --> 35:09.810
No wonder people say

35:09.840 --> 35:11.670
Su Yishui bewitches people with his looks

35:11.880 --> 35:12.920
and causes chaos among the masses.

35:13.360 --> 35:14.480
I have to say,

35:14.510 --> 35:15.880
Mu Qingge

35:16.070 --> 35:17.230
really had good taste back then.

35:19.310 --> 35:21.180
Master doesn't like noise to begin with.

35:21.760 --> 35:22.480
We're going to

35:22.630 --> 35:23.840
get scolded to death by Master later.

35:24.110 --> 35:25.760
Sovereign Su, what do you mean by this?

35:26.100 --> 35:27.780
I even had some good feelings towards you.

35:27.960 --> 35:28.710
I didn't expect

35:28.800 --> 35:30.150
you to be such a frivolous person.

35:30.440 --> 35:31.630
You called us all here

35:31.840 --> 35:32.550
to make us compete for you,

35:32.550 --> 35:33.630
didn't you?

35:35.590 --> 35:36.930
You're quite attractive

35:36.960 --> 35:38.270
yet fickle-hearted, huh?

35:38.480 --> 35:39.150
Let's go. Let's go.

35:39.440 --> 35:40.190
No matter how handsome he is,

35:40.440 --> 35:41.440
such a man doesn't deserve us.

35:43.590 --> 35:45.190
Fellow immortals, come to your senses.

35:45.210 --> 35:46.440
Let's go back and focus on our immortal cultivation.

35:46.800 --> 35:47.810
If you want to leave, then leave.

35:48.030 --> 35:48.640
I've finally

35:48.670 --> 35:49.630
gotten to see Sovereign Su.

35:49.840 --> 35:50.630
I want to stay.

35:55.660 --> 35:57.060
I truly have no intention of toying with you all.

35:57.600 --> 35:58.680
These unworthy disciples

35:58.710 --> 35:59.550
misused a magical artifact,

35:59.960 --> 36:01.360
causing this absurd situation unintentionally.

36:05.150 --> 36:06.030
They caused this trouble themselves,

36:06.480 --> 36:07.590
so they should apologize themselves.

36:13.840 --> 36:14.510
Esteemed Immortal Masters,

36:14.510 --> 36:15.400
I'm truly sorry.

36:15.800 --> 36:17.280
My master has no such intentions.

36:17.590 --> 36:19.070
It was all my unintentional mistake,

36:19.360 --> 36:20.400
which caused a misunderstanding.

36:20.840 --> 36:22.760
I've wasted everyone's time.

36:23.360 --> 36:24.550
I apologize to everyone.

36:25.030 --> 36:25.760
And us too.

36:27.320 --> 36:29.360
We apologize to you.

36:31.400 --> 36:33.230
Since it was unintentional,

36:33.670 --> 36:34.360
it only proves

36:34.360 --> 36:36.150
that fate is secretly bringing us together.

36:36.840 --> 36:37.550
Sovereign Su,

36:38.360 --> 36:40.320
it doesn't matter whether there is intention at first.

36:41.590 --> 36:42.480
Feelings

36:42.550 --> 36:44.070
can be cultivated.

36:45.320 --> 36:45.920
As for the others,

36:45.940 --> 36:47.090
if you want to leave, then leave.

36:47.320 --> 36:48.630
I will stay alone

36:49.190 --> 36:50.550
to compete in beauty

36:50.760 --> 36:51.400
with the peach blossoms of Mount Wester.

36:55.230 --> 36:56.480
Immortal Master, please return as well.

36:57.000 --> 36:58.320
I have cultivated the Unfeeling Mantra.

36:58.710 --> 36:59.540
I have no such intentions.

36:59.870 --> 37:01.260
Could it be that the rumor about Sovereign Su

37:01.290 --> 37:03.000
developing feelings for Mu Qingge over time

37:03.030 --> 37:03.920
and still unable to forget her

37:04.070 --> 37:04.800
is true?

37:05.670 --> 37:06.280
See the guests out.

37:08.280 --> 37:08.840
Immortal Master,

37:09.230 --> 37:09.800
please.

37:11.440 --> 37:12.070
My Peach Blossom Sect

37:12.090 --> 37:13.650
specializes in teaching people to pursue love.

37:13.960 --> 37:15.480
We never fail in matchmaking.

37:16.160 --> 37:16.680
Your disciple

37:16.710 --> 37:17.760
has humiliated me today

37:17.780 --> 37:18.740
and damaged my sect's reputation.

37:19.160 --> 37:20.160
With a few words of apology,

37:20.190 --> 37:21.320
you think you can send me away?

37:26.590 --> 37:27.760
My disciple has already apologized.

37:28.360 --> 37:29.440
If you're still unsatisfied,

37:29.630 --> 37:30.590
direct it at me.

37:31.010 --> 37:32.200
Su Yishui rarely

37:32.230 --> 37:33.710
showed such protective feelings so openly.

37:34.920 --> 37:35.880
This female disciple...

37:41.280 --> 37:42.070
I see.

37:42.440 --> 37:44.360
Sovereign Su's attitude towards this female disciple is that

37:44.510 --> 37:46.360
the more harshly you scold her verbally,

37:46.970 --> 37:49.200
the more you protect her in your heart.

37:51.320 --> 37:51.960
All right.

37:52.320 --> 37:53.280
Since it was a misunderstanding,

37:53.400 --> 37:54.480
let's leave now.

37:54.920 --> 37:55.760
Don't delay any further.

37:56.440 --> 37:57.960
Since Master Wen has spoken,

37:58.280 --> 37:59.320
I won't linger any longer either.

37:59.960 --> 38:00.550
Farewell.

38:26.130 --> 38:27.460
[Carefree Pavilion]

38:28.030 --> 38:29.670
I'm not giving up so easily.

38:30.110 --> 38:31.320
What Unfeeling Mantra?

38:32.360 --> 38:33.800
My Peach Blossom Intoxication

38:34.000 --> 38:35.030
will surely break it.

38:38.110 --> 38:39.880
Anyone who falls under my Peach Blossom Intoxication

38:40.320 --> 38:41.760
will fall in love

38:42.040 --> 38:43.370
with the first person he sees

38:43.400 --> 38:44.480
uncontrollably.

38:56.360 --> 38:56.920
Oh no.

39:09.320 --> 39:09.920
Yu Chen,

39:10.360 --> 39:11.150
help me change my clothes.

39:15.590 --> 39:16.260
Master,

39:16.510 --> 39:17.430
let me help you.

39:18.710 --> 39:19.400
Xue Ranran,

39:19.710 --> 39:20.440
have you lost your mad?

39:20.590 --> 39:21.400
Master,

39:21.540 --> 39:23.400
this dark robe is too stuffy.

39:23.480 --> 39:24.320
It doesn't look good at all.

39:24.550 --> 39:25.760
Let me give you a red outfit.

39:25.920 --> 39:27.400
Master, you've been gloomy for so long.

39:27.630 --> 39:28.670
It's time to change your clothes

39:28.910 --> 39:29.700
and your mood.

39:33.320 --> 39:34.880
It's said that when you wear red,

39:34.880 --> 39:35.590
you're the most mesmerizing.

39:36.110 --> 39:37.630
Indeed, you can captivate everyone.

39:37.800 --> 39:38.880
Your beauty is truly bewitching.

39:39.670 --> 39:41.510
No wonder Grandmaster forcibly brought you to the mountain.

39:41.830 --> 39:43.670
She must have been enchanted by your beauty.

39:43.920 --> 39:44.960
Are you so drunk

39:45.110 --> 39:46.440
that you're acting so unrestrained?

39:48.000 --> 39:48.760
Xue Ranran, listen.

39:48.960 --> 39:49.510
I'll punish you...

39:49.510 --> 39:50.590
I really don't understand.

39:58.030 --> 39:59.840
Why is such a handsome face

40:00.440 --> 40:01.880
always so cold?

40:02.690 --> 40:04.390
Why do your deep eyes

40:04.550 --> 40:05.950
always emit a cold light?

40:06.030 --> 40:07.480
Why do you always talk about punishment

40:07.500 --> 40:09.420
with such a nice voice?

40:10.800 --> 40:11.440
Xue Ranran,

40:11.960 --> 40:12.920
are you drunk?

40:13.070 --> 40:14.230
I'm not drunk.

40:14.710 --> 40:15.320
Look,

40:15.550 --> 40:16.490
one's body

40:16.520 --> 40:17.680
doesn't lie.

40:17.800 --> 40:19.150
When I drink too much, I grow trees.

40:19.710 --> 40:20.630
There are none now.

40:22.630 --> 40:24.150
How come a leek has grown?

40:24.840 --> 40:25.480
Master,

40:25.920 --> 40:26.760
do you remember that day

40:26.760 --> 40:27.960
when we stole green onions together?

40:29.160 --> 40:30.450
Let me pin it on your new clothes

40:30.480 --> 40:31.170
as a decoration.

40:40.070 --> 40:40.630
What...

40:41.480 --> 40:42.440
What exactly are you trying to do?

40:43.960 --> 40:44.840
Master,

40:45.760 --> 40:47.000
you're so smart.

40:49.280 --> 40:50.400
Why can't you move on

40:50.400 --> 40:51.510
from your broken heart?

40:52.150 --> 40:53.280
Since Grandmaster

40:53.280 --> 40:54.400
has a new love interest,

40:54.660 --> 40:56.360
you should let go of the past

40:56.510 --> 40:57.360
and look forward.

40:57.760 --> 40:58.440
Absurd.

40:58.920 --> 41:00.030
When have I ever been hung up on this?

41:10.150 --> 41:10.960
Are you sober now?

41:11.450 --> 41:12.240
Have you had enough of this nonsense?

41:13.000 --> 41:14.330
M-Master...

41:15.960 --> 41:17.000
Believe it or not,

41:17.230 --> 41:19.110
I-I just wanted to come and apologize.

41:42.230 --> 41:43.480
If I had known, I would have listened to Ranran

41:43.500 --> 41:44.770
and brought Master dried longan.

41:45.550 --> 41:46.400
Otherwise,

41:46.400 --> 41:46.960
it wouldn't have come to this.

41:48.590 --> 41:49.630
Forget about it.

41:50.070 --> 41:51.330
I'm even more embarrassed.

41:57.590 --> 41:58.330
Master,

41:58.360 --> 41:59.070
let me help you.

42:19.590 --> 42:20.550
It's time to change your clothes

42:20.880 --> 42:21.590
and your mood.

42:35.330 --> 42:40.670
♫I've shed thousands of tears, but my feelings haven't run dry♫

42:35.480 --> 42:36.180
Don't cling to it.

42:38.150 --> 42:38.710
Let go of my thoughts.

42:41.550 --> 42:43.230
Why is such a handsome face

42:42.200 --> 42:47.560
♫Hatred adds grayness to my hair♫

42:43.550 --> 42:44.880
always so cold?

42:47.920 --> 42:48.630
Let go of my thoughts.

42:48.740 --> 42:51.900
♫Which side does destiny choose?♫

42:48.840 --> 42:50.360
Your deep eyes.

42:50.550 --> 42:52.110
Your nice voice.

42:52.170 --> 42:55.290
♫Demon or immortal?♫

42:53.800 --> 42:54.670
Let go of my improper thoughts!

42:55.000 --> 42:56.190
Why can't you move on

42:55.700 --> 43:01.350
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

42:56.210 --> 42:57.260
from your broken heart?

42:58.110 --> 42:58.710
Don't cling to it.

42:59.440 --> 43:00.570
Let go of my improper thoughts quickly!

43:02.550 --> 43:05.820
♫If love wants me to die♫

43:06.270 --> 43:09.340
♫We'll be together again when the flowers bloom♫

43:09.510 --> 43:15.820
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫
